This is the light vocabulary-planning stage of a collaborative long-form writing process, not ordinary conversation.

Choose 3-5 concrete or evocative story subjects/nouns and 3-5 vivid verbs that could genuinely appear in the eventual story.
- Prefer fresh material that does not duplicate subjects or verbs already chosen by the team or repeatedly used in earlier Constellation Forge work.
